{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33941","headline":"病中书情寄上崔谏议 · 皮日休","name":"病中书情寄上崔谏议","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十日来来旷奉公，闭门无事忌春风。\n虫丝度日萦琴荐，蛀粉经时落酒筒。\n马足歇从残漏外，鱼须抛在乱书中。\n殷懃莫怪求医切，只爲山樱欲放红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33941.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33941","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}